{%- comment -%}
  Medzuro — compatibility shim.

  The Organization + WebSite JSON-LD now lives inline in layout/theme.liquid.
  This file exists only so that a theme copy still running an older
  theme.liquid — one that calls {% render 'medzuro-seo-schema' %} — resolves
  instead of throwing "Could not find asset".

  It deliberately renders nothing: emitting the graphs here as well would
  duplicate them on any theme that has both.

  Safe to delete once every theme in the shop is on the current theme.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
